    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > On The Lot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Odd Jobs on the Lot, you and your friends take on the most overlooked but essential tasks of the car park\u2014return runaway trolleys, clean up rubbish, wash cars, deliver parcels, and load groceries straight into customers\u2019 boots. Sounds simple? Think again. With chaotic physics, time pressure, and unexpected obstacles (like mischievous shoppers and rogue traffic cones), these odd jobs turn into hilarious challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/8fbced050c77389f16720c9fd2821930.poster.avif?t=1755759816\" width=1536 height=588 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/8fbced050c77389f16720c9fd2821930.webm?t=1755759816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/8fbced050c77389f16720c9fd2821930.mp4?t=1755759816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ increasingly wacky levels of car park mayhem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole cast of Australian and international animals in customisable outfits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return trolleys, clean messes, wash dirty cars, and perform \u201cdirect to boot\u201d deliveries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into drivable vehicles to help (or hinder) your progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on parcel delivery missions and time-sensitive jobs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo mode for the lone worker\u2026 or 2\u20134 player co-op for maximum chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op tasks that require real coordination\u2014split up or team up to finish jobs efficiently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master each level to climb the job performance board!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally scored soundtrack featuring jazz, rock, and beats by award-winning Epoch Music composers\u2014bringing energy and style to every shift!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With special thanks going to\u00a0Dark Half Studios for trailer and in game audio!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re playing alone or laughing with friends, Odd Jobs on the Lot turns everyday errands into a slapstick adventure of teamwork, timing, and trolley wrangling.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > On The Lot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Odd Jobs on the Lot, you and your friends take on the most overlooked but essential tasks of the car park\u2014return runaway trolleys, clean up rubbish, wash cars, deliver parcels, and load groceries straight into customers\u2019 boots. Sounds simple? Think again. With chaotic physics, time pressure, and unexpected obstacles (like mischievous shoppers and rogue traffic cones), these odd jobs turn into hilarious challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/8fbced050c77389f16720c9fd2821930.poster.avif?t=1755759816\" width=1536 height=588 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/8fbced050c77389f16720c9fd2821930.webm?t=1755759816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/8fbced050c77389f16720c9fd2821930.mp4?t=1755759816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ increasingly wacky levels of car park mayhem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole cast of Australian and international animals in customisable outfits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return trolleys, clean messes, wash dirty cars, and perform \u201cdirect to boot\u201d deliveries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into drivable vehicles to help (or hinder) your progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on parcel delivery missions and time-sensitive jobs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo mode for the lone worker\u2026 or 2\u20134 player co-op for maximum chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op tasks that require real coordination\u2014split up or team up to finish jobs efficiently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master each level to climb the job performance board!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally scored soundtrack featuring jazz, rock, and beats by award-winning Epoch Music composers\u2014bringing energy and style to every shift!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With special thanks going to\u00a0Dark Half Studios for trailer and in game audio!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re playing alone or laughing with friends, Odd Jobs on the Lot turns everyday errands into a slapstick adventure of teamwork, timing, and trolley wrangling.</p>",
    "short_description": "A physics-powered, 1-4 player co-op set in a vibrant Australian carpark. Teammates race to complete a rotating roster of odd jobs avoiding hazards and losing wages. Manage chaos collecting stray trolleys, unloading delivery trucks, cleaning up trash, or delivering groceries directly to car boots.",
